{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00449",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a few minutes behind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.61,
      "end_seconds": 9.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.91,
      "end_seconds": 15.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.33,
      "end_seconds": 20.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 22.42,
      "end_seconds": 27.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a high reading at home. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.98,
      "end_seconds": 36.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.03,
      "end_seconds": 44.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.49,
      "end_seconds": 55.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "It's a... um, uh, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.54,
      "end_seconds": 60.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Okay, do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.1,
      "end_seconds": 70.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "For my cholesterol, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.5,
      "end_seconds": 92.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "How far back does it go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.94,
      "end_seconds": 95.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "About three weeks, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 97.51,
      "end_seconds": 101.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "It was closer to a month, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.1,
      "end_seconds": 107.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.52,
      "end_seconds": 111.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Yes, somewhere around that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.24,
      "end_seconds": 114.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.53,
      "end_seconds": 119.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Uh, about a five out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.96,
      "end_seconds": 126.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 126.45,
      "end_seconds": 132.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.52,
      "end_seconds": 140.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've also had a little puffiness in the ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.28,
      "end_seconds": 144.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "What's the pattern, is it there all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.18,
      "end_seconds": 148.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Honestly, all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.9,
      "end_seconds": 153.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.81,
      "end_seconds": 161.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.72,
      "end_seconds": 168.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.6,
      "end_seconds": 172.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.65,
      "end_seconds": 176.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Right, have you had headaches in the mornings?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.98,
      "end_seconds": 179.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.16,
      "end_seconds": 185.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.97,
      "end_seconds": 188.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.58,
      "end_seconds": 197.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Have you had a ringing in the ears?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.46,
      "end_seconds": 202.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Yeah. About a month, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.16,
      "end_seconds": 210.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Alright, have you had a high reading at home before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.71,
      "end_seconds": 218.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.51,
      "end_seconds": 222.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Alright, how about breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.21,
      "end_seconds": 224.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Definitely no breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.31,
      "end_seconds": 230.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Any sign of palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.53,
      "end_seconds": 234.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, none, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 235.97,
      "end_seconds": 240.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.76,
      "end_seconds": 247.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.95,
      "end_seconds": 260.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. A few quick ones: vision changes, nosebleeds or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.81,
      "end_seconds": 268.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Um, no vision changes, nosebleeds or weakness, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.93,
      "end_seconds": 272.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.31,
      "end_seconds": 275.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.66,
      "end_seconds": 280.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Have you had to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.75,
      "end_seconds": 289.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I had my thyroid operated on a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.62,
      "end_seconds": 292.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.94,
      "end_seconds": 297.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, no allergies to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.92,
      "end_seconds": 312.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.78,
      "end_seconds": 331.23,
      "duration_seconds": 17.45,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago. I have a couple of drinks on the weekend. Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables. I walk for about half an hour most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.07,
      "end_seconds": 334.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any diagnoses you've been given before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.12,
      "end_seconds": 352.34,
      "duration_seconds": 14.22,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for two years. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.31,
      "end_seconds": 354.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.82,
      "end_seconds": 362.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for about ten years now. I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.5,
      "end_seconds": 366.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Right, can I take your vitals now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.88,
      "end_seconds": 375.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.7,
      "end_seconds": 395.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, blood pressure 168 over 103, pulse is 86 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.29,
      "end_seconds": 400.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Uh, uh, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.91,
      "end_seconds": 403.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I'll explain what that means shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.14,
      "end_seconds": 407.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.08,
      "end_seconds": 410.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.22,
      "end_seconds": 412.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "I'll go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.59,
      "end_seconds": 424.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.0,
      "end_seconds": 426.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.1,
      "end_seconds": 429.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.12,
      "end_seconds": 445.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "There's mild pitting swelling at both ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.8,
      "end_seconds": 464.55,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "Alright, good, that's the examination. Putting it all together, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be hypertension that isn't well controlled, or it might be a side effect from the current tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 467.64,
      "end_seconds": 469.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.18,
      "end_seconds": 482.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with hypertension that isn't well controlled do well once it's treated properly. Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 486.39,
      "end_seconds": 496.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "I did have a urine test for protein done last month, um, but the paper's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 498.15,
      "end_seconds": 503.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I'll request kidney function tests, it'll help with hypertension. Any last questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 503.97,
      "end_seconds": 506.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. Bye."
    }
  ]
}